{"name":"BooleanAnalysis.plancherel","v":1,"source_hash":"185e3ee6356352a2","lines":["n : ℕ","f g : BooleanFunc n","⊢ innerProduct f g = ∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g S","expand : innerProduct f g = ∑ S, ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * innerProduct (chiS S) (chiS T)","⊢ innerProduct f g = ∑ S, ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * innerProduct (chiS S) (chiS T)","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, f x * g x =","    ∑ x, ∑ x_1, fourierCoeff f x * fourierCoeff g x_1 * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x_2, chiS x x_2 * chiS x_1 x_2)","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x =","x : BoolCube n","⊢ f x * g x = (∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x","    ∑ S, ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ ∑ i, 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S i) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T i) =","⊢ ∑ x, ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x)) =","⊢ ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","    ∑ x, ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x))","⊢ ∀ x ∈ Finset.univ,","    2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","      ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x))","a✝ : x ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","    ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x))","⊢ x ∈ Finset.univ →","⊢ ∑ i, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f i * chiS i x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","⊢ ∀ x_1 ∈ Finset.univ,","    2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","      ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x))","a✝¹ : x ∈ Finset.univ","S : Finset (Fin n)","a✝ : S ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","    ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x))","⊢ S ∈ Finset.univ →","    2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","      ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x))","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x) =","⊢ ∑ y, ∑ x, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f y * chiS y x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x)) =","    ∑ x_1, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f x * chiS x x_1 * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x_1)) =","      ∑ T, fourierCoeff f x * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x_1, chiS x x_1 * chiS T x_1)","⊢ ∑ x, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x)) =","    ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","    ∑ x, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x)) =","      ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ ∑ y, ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g y * chiS y x)) =","    ∑ x_1, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x_1 * (fourierCoeff g x * chiS x x_1)) =","      fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g x * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x_1, chiS S x_1 * chiS x x_1)","a✝¹ : S ∈ Finset.univ","T : Finset (Fin n)","a✝ : T ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x)) =","    fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ T ∈ Finset.univ →","    ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x)) =","      fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ ∑ x, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS S x * chiS T x)) =","    ∑ x, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff g T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS S x * chiS T x))","    2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff g T * chiS T x)) =","      fourierCoeff f S * fourierC